0,Language isolate - Wikipedia,https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Language_isolate,"A language isolate, sometimes called an isolated language, is a language that has no demonstrable genealogical relationship with any other language. [1][2] That is, an isolate is a language family that only contains one member.",Cayubaba,Language isolate
